WEBVTT

00:12:58.042 --> 00:13:00.143
that you would say to
kick off a negotiation

00:13:00.167 --> 00:13:01.559
or to drive home your point?

00:13:01.583 --> 00:13:02.934
JB: (Laughs)

00:13:02.958 --> 00:13:06.768
Well, I think I sometimes
would certainly just --

00:13:06.792 --> 00:13:08.976
my offers were too low to begin with.

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:10.768
AG: How much were you lowballing by?

00:13:10.792 --> 00:13:15.601
JB: Let's see, I believe
my initial offer was --

00:13:15.625 --> 00:13:17.976
it ended up probably
being about 1 million dollars

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:21.809
per year lower than what
we ended up settling on.

00:13:21.833 --> 00:13:25.726
AG: Wow, and the agent
just thought that was ridiculous?

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:28.768
JB: I don't think he even
viewed it as a first offer.

00:13:28.792 --> 00:13:30.792
AG: Did you ever lose a player you wanted?